  "definition": "Fees",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-12-11",
  "historyNote": "#9851, eff 1-14-11; ss by #10344, eff 5-22-13); ss by #12943, eff 12-11-19 (formerly He-P 309.09); renumbered by #13282, INTERIM (formerly He-P 309.13) (see Revision Note at part heading for He-P 309)",
